From {{inh|en|enm|hath}}, {{m|enm|heth}}, {{m|enm|hafth}}, {{m|enm|hefth}}, from {{inh|en|ang|hæfþ}}, {{m|ang|hafaþ||has}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*habaiþi||has}}, equivalent to {{suffix|en|have|th}}. Cognate with {{cog|stq|häd||has}}, {{cog|fy|hat||has}}, {{cog|nl|heeft||has}}, {{cog|af|het||has, have}}, {{cog|nds-de|hett||has}}, {{cog|de|hat||has}}.

