===Etymology===
{{etymon|en|:inh|enm:empire}}
From {{inh|en|enm|empire}}, from {{der|en|fro|empire}}, {{m|fro|empere}}, from {{der|en|la|imperium}}, {{m|la|inperium||command, control, dominion, sovereignty, a dominion, empire}}, from {{m|la|imperare}}, {{m|la|inperare||to command, order}}, from {{m|la|in||in, on}} + {{m|la|parare||to make ready, order}}. {{doublet|en|empery|imperium}}.

