# {{lb|en|of type|typography}} [[upright|Upright]], as opposed to [[italic]].
#: {{ant|en|italic|[[italicise]]d|[[italicize]]d|oblique|slanted|sloped}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2021|author=Claire Cock-Starkey|title=Hyphens & Hashtags|publisher=Bodleian Library|page=48|passage=In some early printed Bibles quoted text is indicated by changing the font from '''roman''' to italic.}}
# {{lb|en|of text|typesetting|computing}} Of or related to the [[Latin alphabet]] or [[roman numeral]]s.
#: {{cot|en|Arabic#Adjective|arabic#Adjective}}

====Derived terms====
