# {{lb|en|ambitransitive}} To [[domineer]] or [[act]] like a lord.
#* {{RQ:Spenser Shepheardes Calender|December|year=1586
|passage=The grisly toadstool grown there might I see, / And loathed paddocks '''lording''' on the same.}}
