====Conjunction====
{{en-head|conj}}

# {{lb|en|mathematics}} The binomial coefficient of the previous and following [[number]].
#: ''The number of distinct subsets of size ''k'' from a set of size ''n'' is <math>\tbinom nk</math> or "''n'' '''choose''' ''k''".''

=====See also=====
* {{pedia|Binomial coefficient}}

===Etymology 2===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*ǵews-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|chose}}, {{m|enm|chos}}, {{m|enm|chooce}}, a Northern dialectal form of {{m+|enm|chois|t=choice}}. Cognate with {{cog|sco|chose}}, {{m|sco|choose}}, {{m|sco|chuse|t=choosing, choice, selection}}. {{doublet|en|choice}}, see which for more.

====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|obsolete|Northern England|Scotland}} The act of [[choosing]]; [[selection]].
# {{lb|en|obsolete|Northern England|Scotland}} The power, right, or privilege of choosing; [[election]].

