===Etymology===
{{ety|en|:inh|enm:lef<id:leaf>|tree=1}}
From {{inh|en|enm|lef|id=leaf}}, {{m|enm|leef}}, from {{inh|en|ang|lēaf|id=leaf}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*laub}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*laubą|t=leaf}}, from {{inh|en|ine-pro||*lowbʰ-o-m}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*lewbʰ-|t=to cut off|id=cut off}}.<ref>{{R:itc:EDL|page=337}}</ref>
{{col-top|2|cog}}
Cognate with {{cog|sco|leaf|t=leaf}}, {{cog|yol|laafe|t=leaf}}, {{cog|frr|luuf|t=leaf}}, {{cog|stq|Loof|t=leaf}}, {{cog|fy|leaf|t=leaf}}, {{cog|cim|loap|t=leaf}}, {{cog|nl|loof|t=foliage}}, {{cog|de|Laub|t=leaves}}, {{cog|nds-de|Loov|t=leaf}}, {{cog|lb|Laf|t=foliage, leaves}}, {{cog|mhn|lap|t=leaf}}, {{cog|wym|łaub}}, {{m|wym|łaup}}, {{m|wym|łojp|t=leaf}}, {{cog|da,nb|løv|t=leaf}}, {{cog|fo|leyv|t=leaf}}, {{cog|is|lauf|t=leaf}}, {{cog|nn|lauv|t=leaf}}, {{cog|sv|löv|t=leaf}}, {{cog|got|𐌻𐌰𐌿𐍆𐍃|t=leaf}}; also {{cog|ga|luibh|t=herb, plant}}, {{cog|la|liber|t=bast; book|id=book}}, {{cog|sq|labë|t=rind}}, {{cog|lt|lúobas|t=bark; bast}}, {{cog|pl|łub|t=bark}}, {{cog|ru|луб|t=bast}}.
